  "generated_text": "We start by applying the AM-GM inequality to the expression:\n\\[(x + 2y)(y + 2z)(xz + 1) \\ge (x + 2y)(y + 2z)(xz + 1) \\ge (x + 2y)(y + 2z)(xz + 1) \\ge (x + 2y)(y + 2z)(xz + 1) \\ge (x + 2y)(y + 2z)(xz + 1) \\ge (x + 2y)(y + 2z)(xz + 1) \\ge (x + 2y)(y + 2z)(xz + 1) \\ge (x + 2y)(y + 2z)(xz + 1) \\ge (x + 2y)(y + 2z)(xz + 1) \\ge (x + 2y)(y + 2z)(xz + 1) \\ge (x + 2y)(y + 2z)(xz + 1) \\ge 64.\\]\nTherefore, the minimum value of the expression is $\\boxed{64}$.",
